      "person_id": "lrq_cdc_wxj",
      "source_quote": "元德果勁有計略，宋武帝甚知之，告以義舉，使於都下襲玄。",
      "reading": "宋武帝知元德果勁有謀，囑在都下襲桓玄。",
      "note": "宋武帝知元德果勁有謀，囑在都下襲桓玄。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:received_sentence1-27",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "lrq_cdc_wxj",
      "source_quote": "仲德聞其謀，謂元德曰：「天下事不可不密，且兵亦不貴遲巧。",
      "reading": "仲德勸元德密謀速行。",
      "note": "仲德勸元德密謀速行。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 27,
