      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:received_sentence1-55",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "lrq_cdc_wxj",
      "source_quote": "玄情無遠慮，好冒夜出入，今取之正須一夫力耳。」",
      "reading": "所謂一夫力是估攻玄難易。",
      "note": "所謂一夫力是估攻玄難易。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 78,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:received_sentence1-78",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "lrq_cdc_wxj",
      "source_quote": "事泄，元德為玄誅，仲德竄走。",
      "reading": "事泄，桓玄誅元德，仲德逃。",
      "note": "事泄，桓玄誅元德，仲德逃。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 78,
      "end_codepoint": 92,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:received_sentence1-92",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "lrq_cdc_wxj",
      "source_quote": "會義軍克建鄴，仲德抱元德子方回出候武帝，帝于馬上抱方回，與仲德相對號慟。",
      "reading": "義軍克建鄴後，仲德攜元德子方回出迎，帝抱方回，與仲德同哭。",
      "note": "義軍克建鄴後，仲德攜元德子方回出迎，帝抱方回，與仲德同哭。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangrui:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 92,
      "end_codepoint": 128,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
